{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1502498-angels-of-death","id":1502498,"title":"Angels of Death","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-02-08T03:35:32-08:00","id":1502498,"title":"Angels of Death","content":"So... Angels of Death can reduce a Mage's Gnosis by a dot. Which can reduce a Mage to a Sleepwalker, if they drop to zero. Granted, it's just an example Boon, but that's still pretty terrifying.<br /> <br /> 1. How impractical would it be to get every Obrimos in a Consilium together to summon a swarm of them to send against the local Tetrarch? I assume &quot;very&quot;.<br /> <br /> 1a. What kind of fallout would occur from such a strike occurring, or succeeding?<br /> <br /> 2. What kind of trial would you expect an Azrael to demand in exchange for use of the Death of Magic boon?<br /> <br /> 3. Purely on the aesthetic level, how do you imagine one looking?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-08T04:23:55-08:00","id":1502499,"title":"","content":"IIRC, the Angels of the Aether both follow and demand a strict moral code, and one not necessarily tempered by the nuances of humanity. A \u2018wrong\u2019 summon likely ends up smiting the uppity Diamond or Libertine who thinks she has the right to condemn someone\u2019s gnosis (and Gnosis).<br /> <br /> Oh wait a minute, Tetrarch? As in the Seers? The Father will not be pleased. Prepare for judgment.<br /> <br /> For Trials, maybe something that proves the summoner willing to forsake her own magic? This one\u2019s gonna vary wildly Entity-by-Entity.<br /> <br /> I imagine at least one Seraph of Death out there looking like a living blizzard, and at least one Cherub out there looking like a black cat or owl with ominous markings on its body and too-human eyes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-08T05:28:20-08:00","id":1502501,"title":"","content":"1- Very sounds about right. You need to summon enough to provide several uses of the Boon. Which probably requires setting up a specialized summoning area away from prying eyes, investing all the time and effort needed for those summonings, passing multiple Trials and convincing them to grant the Boon (which probably is an ordeal in itself). Then finally dealing with the Acts of Hubris from dimming the light of the Supernal in the world.<br /> <br /> On a side note, I imagine it activating by placing one's hand on the subject, then speaking the Azrael's condemnation of the accused in High Speech. In a moment of deafening silence, a dying breath is heard and a flowing cloud of mana appears, drawing a &lt;Path color&gt; light from the subject before vanishing.<br /> <br /> 1.a- The highest authority of the Lex Magicka in the Consilium would likely be called to conduct an investigation, to confirm if the participants are not becoming Banishers, make sure they were not infected by one and verify if any Rapt were created. The Guardians would be working overtime to deal with the fallout and its very likely an Arrow of the Council of Dragons would be called to shore up the defenses of the Consilium from a highly likely retaliation.<br /> <br /> 2- One of the mage's most significant sympathetic connections will gain a dot in the Dreamer merit (<i>Hurt Locker</i> page 82) to hunt down someone the angel wants dead, losing any accumulated dots once the mission is accomplished. The angel of death is equitable and fair, so there probably is a Supernal justification for it, although it can cause no end of trouble for the summoner. Just like the mage is taking control of another's supernatural life unto themselves, they need to prove they can handle it by becoming responsible for how their actions affect the lives of both people.<br /> <br /> <br /> 3- I find that the <a href=\"https://www.angelarium.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Angelarium</a> is an outstanding source for inspiration on the art and feel of Aetherial angels, in this case:<br /> <br /> <img data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/54243095e4b07ee637a9f812/1553200928427-KUU728DO1BTQDUMTJM2E/azrael_seraphim_angel_death_Mohrbacher\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/54243095e4b07ee637a9f812/1553200928427-KUU728DO1BTQDUMTJM2E/azrael_seraphim_angel_death_Mohrbacher\" data-thumb-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/54243095e4b07ee637a9f812/1553200928427-KUU728DO1BTQDUMTJM2E/azrael_seraphim_angel_death_Mohrbacher\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> \u200b <b><b>AZRAEL, ANGEL OF DEATH</b></b><br /> <br /> <br /> I have watched you since you were born<br /> I wrote your name in my book as you came into this world<br /> I have had an eye watching your entire life<br /> See now, your name fades with time<br /> And now you shall return from whence you came<br /> Delivered from this mortal coil<br /> <br /> Let this apple take your body from you<br /> Let my hand guide you to your rightful place<br /> For I am your shepherd<br /> <br /> Blessed are the dead<br /> And now you are among them<br /> Delivered from this mortal coil<br /> <br /> <i>written by Peter Mohrbacher</i><br /> \u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 02-08-2023, 11:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-08T05:54:25-08:00","id":1502503,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21c hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1502498-angels-of-death?p=1502499#post1502499\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">oh wait a minute, tetrarch? As in the seers? The father will not be pleased. Prepare for judgment.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><b>To have fallen to such lesser hands proves their unworthiness, as is only natural. Now, let us test your mettle in kind.</b></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of